      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "求下列方程的实数解集合。哪张表每行都正确？\n\na) $\\frac4x+1=\\frac{x-1}{x+1}$；\nb) $\\frac1{u-1}+3=\\frac{u-3}{2-u}$；\nc) $\\frac1{5-y}-6=\\frac{1-6y}{y}$；\nd) $\\frac9v+\\frac{2v-3}{v+1}=2$。",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
